Bundle-Name: Fennec Model Atlas - EObject Registry Provider (deprecated, moved to model.atlas)
Bundle-Description: DEPRECATED - this bundle moved to the eclipse-fennec/model.atlas \
 repository (same BSN and packages, Maven group org.eclipse.fennec.model.atlas); this \
 copy is frozen, see README.md. Generic Model Atlas content source for the emf.osgi \
 EObject registry: syncs the objects of configured atlas registries into a named \
 EObjectRegistry through its writer face - resiliently, with retry, periodic refresh \
 and identity-compare-friendly pushes (the atlas client's ETag cache returns identical \
 instances for unchanged objects). Deliberately a writer client, not an initial \
 provider: registry publication must never depend on the network.

-workingset: ModelAtlas

-library: enableEMF

-buildpath: \
	org.eclipse.fennec.model.atlas.scope.api;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.emf.osgi.eobject.registry;version=latest

-testpath: \
	assertj-core;version=latest
